  "title": "Chicken Fricassee",
  "description": "A yummy Cajun dish. Chicken, sausage, onion and celery with a seasoning including cayenne pepper and garlic. And of course, what Cajun dish would be complete without the roux?!",
  "authors": [
    "Laura Poche"
  ],
